## Code Example
```javascript
function rotateFieldsLeft32(x) {
  const A = x & 0x3FF;
  const B = (x >>> 10) & 0x3FF;
  const C = (x >>> 20) & 0x3FF;
  return (B) | (C << 10) | (A << 20);
}
```

